shape: sequence_diagram
ui: Slint UI thread
host: nori-host Handle
queue: nori-core queue
engine: nori-engine thread
load: nori-load thread
out: cpal callback

ui -> host: play(songs, index)
host -> queue: set the new queue
queue -> host: QueueChange {style.stroke-dash: 4}
host -> engine: QueueChanged, PlayAt
engine -> queue: read the queue
engine -> load: fetch the song
load -> engine: bytes, in bursts {style.stroke-dash: 4}
engine -> engine: demux, decode, sound chain
engine -> out: samples, through the ring
engine -> ui: Song and State events {style.stroke-dash: 4}
